// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Appointment sniffer — after HE sends a reply, scan it for
//  scheduling language ("בוא נעשה ב-16 בערב", "מחר בבוקר", "ביום שני
//  ב-14:00") and offer to drop it straight into the calendar. He
//  confirms/edits date-time-title in a modal, so a loose guess is fine.
